{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13437","headline":"小洞庭洄源亭讌四郡太守诗 · 苏源明","name":"小洞庭洄源亭讌四郡太守诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小洞庭兮牵方舟，风嫋嫋兮离平流。\n牵方舟兮小洞庭，云微微兮连绝𡷨\n层澜壮兮缅以没，重岩转兮超以忽。\n冯夷逝兮护轻桡，蛟龙行兮落增潮。\n泊中湖兮澹而闲，并曲漵兮怅而还。\n适予手兮非予期，将解袂兮藂予思。\n尚君子兮寿厥身，承明主兮忧斯人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏源明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}